1
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:03,680
我们还需要买红酒 芝士 鲜花...
Okay, we still need wine, cheese, flowers --

2
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:04,980
我们还得去一趟蛋糕房
Oh, we have to stop by the bakery.

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,519
是 我们还得买个礼物献给女主人
Yeah, and we need a hostess gift

4
00:00:06,519 --> 00:00:08,540
毕竟这是朗吉尼斯办的"感朋节派对"
for Longinus' Friendsgiving party.

5
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:10,880
客人空手上门 他可不会给什么好脸色
You know, she does not look kindly on an empty-handed guest.

6
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:12,600
-太过了 -我懂的
- It's too much. - I know.

7
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:13,600
但你对这种人能有多高指望呢
But what do you expect from somebody

8
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:14,200
毕竟他把名字
who changed their name

9
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,700
都从拉里·琼斯改成朗吉尼斯·圣杰梅茵了
from Larry Jones to Longinus St. Germaine?

10
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:17,699
不是 我是说这清单上的东西过多
No, I mean this list.

11
00:00:17,699 --> 00:00:19,580
听着 我们要想4点赶到我爸家
Okay, we're only making it to my dad's by 4:00

12
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:21,800
只能不去参加曾用名为拉里的人举办的派对了
if we blow off the hostess formerly known as Larry.

13
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:24,000
不要 他的派对是我对于感恩节最爱的部分
No! His party's my favorite thing about Thanksgiving!

14
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:25,300
桌上的人轮流发表感言
Like, when we all go around the table

15
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,520
感恩一件今年没让人烦心的好事
and say one thing we're thankful for not wearing this year.

16
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:28,980
不 不行 抱歉
No. No, I'm sorry. Sorry.

17
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:31,101
就算不参加派对 恐怕最多也只够踩着点到
Even skipping the party, we're barely gonna make it in time.

18
00:00:31,101 --> 00:00:32,260
好了 给
Alright. Here.

19
00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:33,700
我们分配一下 弄完在这里会合
Let's divvy these up and meet back here.

20
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:34,320
好吧 行
Okay, fine.

21
00:00:35,593 --> 00:00:37,699
-你好啊 米奇 -你好 罗纳多
- Oh, hi, Mitch! - Hi, Ronaldo.

22
00:00:37,781 --> 00:00:39,815
让我猜猜 这是给朗吉尼斯买的吗
What -- Let me guess. Those are for Longinus?

23
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:42,300
我可不会给那个毒舌女王买这种烂东西
I would never get something this shabby for that judgy queen.

24
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:44,880
-不是 我妈在住院 -天啊
- No, my mom is in the hospital. - Oh, my God.

25
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:46,100
你们会去参加派对吗
Will I see you guys at the party?

26
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:47,660
恐怕不行
Oh, unfortunately no.

27
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:49,480
今天已经变成一个噩梦了
Uh, this day has turned into something of a nightmare.

28
00:00:50,066 --> 00:00:50,820
小卡去哪儿了
Where's Cam?

29
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:52,060
我们刚刚分开了
We just split up.

30
00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:53,480
我们需要太多不同的东西
We just needed so many different things,

31
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:54,500
还是分开比较好
it was easier to separate.

32
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:56,160
总之 感恩节快乐
So, anyway, happy Thanksgiving.

33
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:57,200
代我向大家问好
Tell everyone I said hi.

34
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,280
比悲伤更悲伤的故事
Super sad news.

35
00:01:02,720 --> 00:01:04,340
猜猜谁刚刚分手了
Guess who just broke up.

36
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:06,340
给个提示 你欠我50块
Hint -- you owe me 50 bucks.

37
00:01:20,860 --> 00:01:22,800
卢克 别再吃棉花糖了
Luke, stop eating all the marshmallows.

38
00:01:23,080 --> 00:01:24,390
这些红薯需要一切能帮忙的人手来处理
Those yams need all the help that they can get.

39
00:01:24,390 --> 00:01:25,469
艾丽克斯 馅料怎么样了
Alex, how's the stuffing?

40
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:27,080
你说呢
You tell me.

41
00:01:27,660 --> 00:01:29,540
我们为什么要过这个傻兮兮的节日
Why do we even have this stupid holiday?

42
00:01:30,520 --> 00:01:32,280
我爸和我妈对我们太好了
Mom and Dad have been incredible --

43
00:01:32,580 --> 00:01:34,680
让我 迪兰和双胞胎跟他们一起生活
letting me, Dylan, and the twins live with them,

44
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:37,520
帮忙在夜间喂奶 给他们讲睡前故事
helping with midnight feedings, bedtime stories.

45
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:39,760
迪兰超爱我爸随角色变声讲故事
Dylan loves it when my dad does the voices.

46
00:01:40,180 --> 00:01:41,840
所以 我想给我妈放个假
So, I'm giving my mom a break

47
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:43,060
今年就不用她来准备感恩节晚餐了
from cooking Thanksgiving dinner.

48
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:44,480
我想做点特别的事
I wanted to do something special

49
00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:45,940
感谢他们在我身边支持我
to thank them for being there for me.

50
00:01:47,123 --> 00:01:48,827
对不起 我只是...
I'm sorry. I've just, um...

51
00:01:50,011 --> 00:01:52,020
我变成了好美好的一个人啊
I've become such a beautiful person.

52
00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:55,900
感恩节快乐 杰
Happy Thanksgiving, Jay.

53
00:01:55,900 --> 00:01:58,060
如果你想跟我一起看 我可以往这边挪点
Oh, I can slide over if you want to watch this with me.

54
00:01:58,300 --> 00:02:00,620
不 我从来都不懂没有坦克的游行有什么意义
Nah. I never saw the point of a parade without tanks.

55
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:02,920
我想带这个飞机出去兜兜风
I'm gonna take the plane out for a spin.

56
00:02:02,980 --> 00:02:03,900
你想一起去吗
You want to come with?

57
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:04,500
我吗
Me?

58
00:02:05,002 --> 00:02:07,711
去 飞行吗
Go...fly?

59
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:10,900
我装得很淡定 但我内心是狂喜的
I played it cool, but I was pretty jazzed.

60
00:02:12,180 --> 00:02:14,280
距离上次杰叫我出去
It's been 10 years since Jay asked me

61
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:18,220
跟他一起玩航模飞机已经有十年了 我...
to go model-plane flying with him, and I was, uh...

62
00:02:18,220 --> 00:02:20,079
我非常迫切地希望能用更美好的记忆
I was eager to replace that memory

63
00:02:20,079 --> 00:02:22,323
来替换掉上次的不堪
with a -- a be-- a better one.

64
00:02:22,820 --> 00:02:24,540
好了 开始吧
Okay, let's do it!

65
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:33,820
你们去哪儿啊
Where are you guys going?

66
00:02:34,220 --> 00:02:35,160
没什么特别的
Oh, nowhere special.

67
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:38,280
就是杰邀我加入他的高空俱乐部[飞机上做爱]
Let's just say that Jay's asked me to join his mile high club.

68
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:39,220
别说这种让人误会的话
Let's not say that.

69
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:39,840
好酷
Cool!

70
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,740
多年前 我差点就加入了
You know, years ago, I almost joined

71
00:02:41,740 --> 00:02:44,444
女性主导的空姐世界
the female-dominated world of flight attendants.

72
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:46,620
我的护士同伴们现在还拿这事刺激我呢
My fellow nurses still needle me about it.

73
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:47,988
我能一起去吗
Can I come?

74
00:02:47,988 --> 00:02:49,260
实际上 杰对于...
Uh, actually, Jay's pretty particular about --

75
00:02:49,260 --> 00:02:50,020
行吧 有何不可
Sure, why not?

76
00:02:51,620 --> 00:02:52,820
看来我们要玩三人行了哦
Looks like we're having a threesome!

77
00:02:52,820 --> 00:02:54,820
你这是在自取其辱
You're embarrassing yourself.

78
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:59,000
火鸡的中间部分还是冰冻的
The turkey is still frozen in the middle!

79
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:01,580
外热 内冷
Hot on the outside, cold on the inside --

80
00:03:01,900 --> 00:03:03,260
真是让我想起了某个人呢
reminds me of a certain someone.

81
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:04,800
-求你别问是谁 -好的
- Please don't ask. - Sure.

82
00:03:05,153 --> 00:03:07,126
这个馅料太酸了
Ugh, this pie filling is so sour.

83
00:03:07,340 --> 00:03:10,000
是啊 当你指望某样东西如蜜一样甜
Yeah, it's devastating when you expect something to be sweet

84
00:03:10,060 --> 00:03:12,880
结果沦落成性心理的强烈折磨 真让人伤心欲绝
but ends up being intense psychosexual torture.

85
00:03:13,220 --> 00:03:14,600
我不想谈论这事
I don't want to talk about it.

86
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,120
-那可太好了 -别担心
- Cool, cool. - Don't worry.

87
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:18,940
卢克著名的果冻杂烩将拯救你们
Luke's famous Jell-o mold is here to save your sorry butts.

88
00:03:22,260 --> 00:03:23,840
我这么多年来就为爸妈做这么一件事
I can't have the one nice thing I've done

89
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:25,040
我不能让它成为灾难
for Mom and Dad be a disaster!

90
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:27,447
艾丽克斯 能请你联系在跟你交往的那个大厨吗
Alex, um, call you please call that chef that you're dating?

91
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:28,960
那个自大的怪胎吗
That pompous weirdo?

92
00:03:29,140 --> 00:03:31,300
我故意赶在节前跟他分手了啊
I purposely broke up with him before the holidays.

93
00:03:31,780 --> 00:03:32,760
如果我现在打给他
If I call him now,

94
00:03:32,760 --> 00:03:34,600
就不得不跟他凑合到新年前了
I will be stuck with him until New Year's.

95
00:03:34,740 --> 00:03:35,580
有一种思想流派认为
There's a school of thought

96
00:03:35,580 --> 00:03:37,368
可能要咬牙坚持到情人节
it can even stretch out to Valentine's Day.

97
00:03:37,368 --> 00:03:39,820
一旦过了感恩节 那后面就是狂野大西部了
Once you pass Thanksgiving, it's the Wild West.

98
00:03:40,380 --> 00:03:42,020
好吧我说 她叫杰西卡
Okay! Her name is Jessica.

99
00:03:42,340 --> 00:03:43,940
我们是在圣塔安娜强风盛行时认识的
We met during a Santa Ana wind,

100
00:03:43,940 --> 00:03:45,600
我们都知道雷蒙德·钱德勒的名言...
and we all know what Raymond Chandler said --

101
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,060
那就没必要重复了
So no need to repeat it.

102
00:03:47,060 --> 00:03:49,260
艾丽克斯 拜托了 你那个大厨能有多怪
Alex, please. How weird can your chef be?

103
00:03:51,029 --> 00:03:52,560
我不知道是不是因为他是个大厨
I don't know if it's 'cause he's a chef

104
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:53,800
大厨的控制欲都比较强
and they can be controlling,

105
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:56,800
我知道爱的语言有很多种不同的表达方式
and I know there's lots of different "love languages,"

106
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:57,340
但是 ...
but...

107
00:03:57,340 --> 00:03:59,560
他把我当木偶一样操控
he puppets me.

108
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:04,240
一定要超级薄和均匀才行 就像这样
You want them to be super thin and uniform, like this.

109
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:06,840
洋葱把你熏得流眼泪了
You're tearing up from the onions.

110
00:04:11,580 --> 00:04:12,540
擤一下
And blow.

111
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:14,540
我还是去洗手间处理一下吧
You know, maybe I'll just go to the bathroom and do this.

112
00:04:14,620 --> 00:04:15,760
好的 我们走
Okay. Sure. Let's go.

113
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:21,740
乔 你在准备座次卡吗
Oh, Joe! You're doing place cards?

114
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:23,540
一般不都是曼尼来做这事吗
Doesn't Manny usually take care of seating?

115
00:04:23,820 --> 00:04:25,600
他"在经历一些事"
He's "going through something."

116
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:28,880
我相信他很快就会忍不住全都说出来的
I'm sure we'll hear a spoken word about it soon enough.

117
00:04:29,140 --> 00:04:31,560
你真的快要变成我爸的4英尺小版了
You really are turning into a 4-foot version of my dad.

118
00:04:31,900 --> 00:04:32,580
是我们的爸爸
Our dad.

119
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,660
那还真是"永远都不会怪"呢
That will never not be weird.

120
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:38,039
歌洛莉亚 你竟然洗衣服
Gloria, you do laundry?

121
00:04:38,039 --> 00:04:40,318
还是说你在遮孕肚
Or are you hiding a pregnancy?

122
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:42,380
不是 女佣辞职了
No. The housekeeper quit.

123
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:48,480
我真的很爱全职为菲尔工作 虽然薪资很少
I really love working for Phil full-time for very little money,

124
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,740
但我当时没意识到
but I didn't realize

125
00:04:49,740 --> 00:04:52,440
要平衡家庭和工作有多难
how hard it was going to be balancing everything.

126
00:04:52,540 --> 00:04:54,920
我懂 所以我才爱不工作的感觉
I know. That's why I love not working.

127
00:04:55,060 --> 00:04:57,820
终于有时间把各种事都做掉了
Finally, enough time to get everything done.

128
00:04:58,020 --> 00:04:58,380
当真吗
Really?

129
00:04:58,820 --> 00:05:01,700
你不怀念面对各种新挑战的感觉吗
You don't miss facing new challenges,

130
00:05:01,980 --> 00:05:03,560
以及竞争的刺激
the fire of competition,

131
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:06,220
和那种成就感
that sense of accomplishment?

132
00:05:07,340 --> 00:05:08,800
不 一点都不
No. No.

133
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:11,340
当然了 我曾担心过我是那种
I mean, of course, I worried I was the type of person

134
00:05:11,340 --> 00:05:14,200
需要一直忙碌才心安的人 但那就像是毒品
who needed to be busy all the time, but it's like a drug --

135
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:16,760
经过几周的戒断
after a couple of weeks of withdrawal,

136
00:05:16,900 --> 00:05:20,160
我终于适应什么也不干的生活了
I am finally comfortable doing nothing.

137
00:05:29,500 --> 00:05:30,818
你买的是什么样的馅饼
Oh, what kind of pie did you get,

138
00:05:30,818 --> 00:05:33,100
南瓜瓜馅 山核桃桃馅 还是甜土豆豆馅的
pun'kin, pee-can, sweet pataytuh?

139
00:05:33,100 --> 00:05:34,160
无面粉巧克力蛋糕
Flourless chocolate cake.

140
00:05:34,380 --> 00:05:35,680
你试试把这说出一股乡村味儿来
Let's see you try and country that up.

141
00:05:36,180 --> 00:05:37,140
我的手机在口袋里
My phone's in my pocket.

142
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:39,000
你能帮我拿一下吗 我够不着
Here, would you grab it? I can't get it.

143
00:05:39,237 --> 00:05:39,780
好了
Alright.

144
00:05:39,780 --> 00:05:41,380
-是谁 -乔撒姆发来短信
- Who is it? - Oh, it's from Jotham.

145
00:05:41,380 --> 00:05:43,840
"我刚听说了 非常遗憾 你还好吗"
"Just heard. I'm so sorry. How are you doing?"

146
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:45,800
-他在说什么 -我不知道
- What's that about? - I have no idea.

147
00:05:45,997 --> 00:05:47,133
是勒迈克
Oh, L'Michael.

148
00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:49,620
-"我的心与你同在 卡麦小芝士 打给我" -啥
- "Sending all my love, Camembert. Call me." - What?

149
00:05:50,740 --> 00:05:51,220
阿耳特弥斯
Artemis.

150
00:05:51,620 --> 00:05:53,560
"罗纳多告诉我你和米奇尔的事了
"Ronaldo told me about you and Mitchell.

151
00:05:53,602 --> 00:05:55,641
心碎表情 眼泪表情
Broken-heart emoji, tear emoji,

152
00:05:55,724 --> 00:05:57,420
老牌喜剧女星塔米·菲·贝克痛哭表情包"
Tammy Faye Bakker crying Gif."

153
00:05:57,420 --> 00:05:58,980
罗纳多到底跟他说了什么啊
What did Ronaldo tell him?

154
00:05:59,140 --> 00:06:02,500
不知道啊 我刚在这碰见他 他问你在哪
No clue. I-I just saw him here, and he asked where you were,

155
00:06:02,500 --> 00:06:04,240
我就说我们分开去购物...
and I told him that we split up to shop and that --

156
00:06:05,080 --> 00:06:06,920
我的天 他以为我们真的分手了
Oh, my God. He thinks we actually split up.

157
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:08,840
结果这消息就传遍基圈了
Oh, and it's gone viral.

158
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:11,160
有两样东西是基佬不肯坐[藏不住]的
Well, there are two things a gay can't sit on --

159
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:13,620
直男坐的丑塑料休闲椅和猛料大八卦
a plastic patio chair and a juicy bit of gossip.

160
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:16,280
不过看到我们的朋友这么有爱 也很感动啦
Well, it's nice to see how supportive our friends are being.

161
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:19,080
是啊 他们真好 第一时间就联系...
Yeah. It's nice how quickly they reached out to --

162
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:19,580
你一个人
to you.

163
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:20,840
我什么都没收到
I got nothing.

164
00:06:22,340 --> 00:06:23,457
这铃声简直就是在嘲笑我
It's like it's mocking me.

165
00:06:23,457 --> 00:06:25,700
这些短信肯定是发给我们两个看的啦
I-I'm sure the texts were meant for both of us.

166
00:06:25,700 --> 00:06:26,980
才不是这样的 好吗
That's not how it works, okay?

167
00:06:26,980 --> 00:06:28,200
他们又不是在感谢我们招待的早午餐
They're not thanking us for brunch.

168
00:06:28,220 --> 00:06:29,100
我们可是要离婚了
We're getting a divorce!

169
00:06:29,660 --> 00:06:31,060
为什么没人打给我啊
Why is no one calling me?!

170
00:06:31,220 --> 00:06:32,960
或许因为他们认为你比起我...
Well, maybe because they think you're the --

171
00:06:32,960 --> 00:06:34,660
更坚强 没那么感情用事
the stronger, less emotional one.

172
00:06:34,660 --> 00:06:36,580
真是疯了 我坚强
That's crazy. Just because I'm strong

173
00:06:36,580 --> 00:06:38,480
也不代表我在这种时候就不需要朋友们的关怀啊
doesn't mean I don't need my friends at a time like this!

174
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:39,299
什么时候
A time like what?

175
00:06:39,299 --> 00:06:42,100
你知道我们不是真的要离婚的吧
Y-You realizing this isn't actually happening, right?

176
00:06:42,100 --> 00:06:42,780
少来
Oh, come on.

177
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:45,240
如果情况反过来 你肯定会慌得一批
If the shoe was on the other foot, you would be freaking out.

178
00:06:45,260 --> 00:06:47,260
没错 所以现在我才会收到这些短信啊
Yes -- which is why I'm getting all the texts.

179
00:06:47,260 --> 00:06:48,425
好吧 你看
Okay, well, here.

180
00:06:48,792 --> 00:06:50,845
是身在意大利卡普里岛的斯蒂芬和斯蒂凡
Ohh, from Steven and Stefan in Capri.

181
00:06:51,100 --> 00:06:54,460
回短信跟他们说 "别特地飞回来 我没事"
Oh. Text back, uh, "Do not fly home. I'm doing okay."

182
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:56,300
我们难道不是没要离婚吗
I thought this wasn't really happening!

183
00:06:59,713 --> 00:07:02,234
桶滚后接个S形转弯
Barrel roll into an S-turn...

184
00:07:03,003 --> 00:07:05,617
再来一招我自创的"普里契特急转"
and a little thing I call Pritchett-Switch-It.

185
00:07:06,211 --> 00:07:07,830
看起来就是普通的右转啊
That just looks like a right-hand turn.

186
00:07:07,830 --> 00:07:09,287
你这外行当然看不懂门道啦
It would to an amateur.

187
00:07:09,460 --> 00:07:10,400
你简直是艺术家 杰
You're an artist, Jay.

188
00:07:10,900 --> 00:07:11,980
天空就是你的画布
The sky's your canvas.

189
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:12,860
要不要来玩"穿针引线"
Oh, should we do the hoop?

190
00:07:13,220 --> 00:07:13,840
好主意
Great idea.

191
00:07:14,140 --> 00:07:16,680
冠军 拿着这个走到空地中间
Hey, champ, take this out to the middle of the field

192
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:17,420
然后高举过头
and hold it up.

193
00:07:17,940 --> 00:07:18,380
太棒了
Awesome!

194
00:07:20,420 --> 00:07:21,740
这次轮到"冠军"是吧
Guess it's "champ's" turn.

195
00:07:21,740 --> 00:07:23,540
真的不用让冠军先看看
Are -- Are we sure champ doesn't need to see

196
00:07:23,540 --> 00:07:24,520
正确玩法是怎样吗
how it's done properly first?

197
00:07:24,580 --> 00:07:25,620
不只是傻站在那就行了
I mean, it's not just standing there.

198
00:07:25,640 --> 00:07:27,160
迪兰 站在那就行
Dylan, just stand there!

199
00:07:33,580 --> 00:07:34,020
好棒
Yes!

200
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:36,800
这共同经历也太美好了
What a wonderful shared experience!

201
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,280
继续站在那
Now, stay out there.

202
00:07:38,660 --> 00:07:39,620
我们再玩一次
We'll do it again.

203
00:07:40,153 --> 00:07:41,928
这小子有天分 一点都没退缩
Kid's a natural. He didn't even flinch.

204
00:07:42,180 --> 00:07:45,120
到底是勇敢还是纯粹迟钝 我们不会知道了
Bravery or a sluggish brain -- guess we'll never know.

205
00:07:46,900 --> 00:07:47,040
抱歉
Sorry.

206
00:07:47,470 --> 00:07:48,969
我就是有点不爽
Just, uh, I'm -- I'm a little annoyed

207
00:07:48,969 --> 00:07:51,074
迪兰强行加入专属于我们的游戏
that Dylan's horning in on our thing.

208
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:54,300
其实我手指有点抽筋了
Hey, you know what, my hands are cramping up.

209
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:55,460
你想接手玩一下吗
You want to take over for me here?

210
00:07:55,460 --> 00:07:56,020
-真的吗 -嗯
- Really? - Yeah.

211
00:07:56,320 --> 00:07:56,800
谢谢
Thanks.

212
00:07:57,069 --> 00:08:00,160
听着 你生迪兰的气 有没有可能
Listen, i-is it possible that you're angry at Dylan

213
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,560
不只是因为今天的事
for something more than today?

214
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:04,098
今早他的确吃掉了最后一块华夫饼
Well, he did take the last waffle this morning.

215
00:08:04,098 --> 00:08:07,487
我觉得是因为... 他抢走了你第一个孩子
I think it's more about -- he took your firstborn.

216
00:08:07,660 --> 00:08:08,381
我也经历过
Now, I've been there.

217
00:08:08,381 --> 00:08:09,417
有这种想法很正常
It's only natural, you know.

218
00:08:09,417 --> 00:08:12,338
我们当爸爸的 对女儿的保护欲很强 但是...
Us dads, we're very protective of our daughters, but, uh...

219
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:15,020
事实上 你可能会很有冲动
In fact, you may get a very strong impulse

220
00:08:15,020 --> 00:08:16,660
把飞机直接撞向那家伙
to fly that plane right into the guy,

221
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,688
但别那么做
but don't do it.

222
00:08:17,688 --> 00:08:19,760
什么 我绝不会伤害迪兰的
What? I-I would -- I would never hurt Dylan.

223
00:08:19,760 --> 00:08:21,320
你怎么会觉得我会有那种冲动
Why would you even think I'd have that impulse?

224
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:22,440
我不知道 我就是觉得...
I don't know. I thought...

225
00:08:23,078 --> 00:08:24,500
你刚才看他的眼神...
you know, the way you were looking at him....

226
00:08:24,500 --> 00:08:24,920
等等
Wait.

227
00:08:26,260 --> 00:08:28,120
你十年前就是那么想的吗
Is that what you were thinking 10 years ago?

228
00:08:28,290 --> 00:08:30,635
这么多年来 我一直以为是我出错了
A-All this time, I thought it was my fault!

229
00:08:30,635 --> 00:08:32,460
我在最后一刻脑袋动了
I-I moved my head at the last second.

230
00:08:32,460 --> 00:08:33,900
其实你是故意撞到我的
But you hit me on purpose!

231
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,780
别说傻话 我只是...
Don't be ridiculous! I just --

232
00:08:35,780 --> 00:08:36,660
只是什么 杰
You just what, Jay?

233
00:08:36,920 --> 00:08:39,060
觉得用飞机撞上我的脸会很好玩是吗
Thought it'd be fun to fly a plane into my face?

234
00:08:39,380 --> 00:08:41,380
什么样的冷血怪物才能对另一个人类做出这种...
What kind of monster does that to another human be--

235
00:08:44,687 --> 00:08:46,093
糟了
Aw, no.

236
00:08:51,180 --> 00:08:52,040
看都伤什么样了
Look at this.

237
00:08:56,100 --> 00:08:57,380
这样应该就可以了
Okay, I think it's good for now.

238
00:08:58,060 --> 00:09:00,580
没错 你需要享受你的私人时间
Oh, yeah, yeah. You need to enjoy your "me" time.

239
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:00,920
没错
Yeah.

240
00:09:00,920 --> 00:09:04,260
昨天 我有三栋房子办了开放参观
Yesterday, I had three open houses.

241
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:06,380
我从早到晚都忙个不停
I was running around all day,

242
00:09:06,380 --> 00:09:08,380
解决各种问题 创造各种价值
solving problems, creating value...

243
00:09:08,636 --> 00:09:10,519
真是累死我了
Ay, it was exhausting.

244
00:09:11,020 --> 00:09:12,420
我可不怀念这种感觉
Yeah. Don't miss that.

245
00:09:13,180 --> 00:09:16,720
其中一栋房子可脏了
Oh, and one of the houses was filthy!

246
00:09:16,820 --> 00:09:19,240
所有窗户都该清洗了
All the windows needed to be washed.

247
00:09:20,100 --> 00:09:21,920
不过我也没脸说人家啦
But I am one to talk.

248
00:09:29,860 --> 00:09:32,560
照我说的去做 我们就能拯救这顿饭
Follow my instructions, and we can save this meal.

249
00:09:32,640 --> 00:09:33,740
-你哪位 -曼尼
- Who are you? - Manny.

250
00:09:33,980 --> 00:09:36,020
错 在这个厨房里 你没有名字 搅拌
Wrong. In this kitchen, you don't have a name. Stir.

251
00:09:36,119 --> 00:09:37,720
你这态度挺有意思的
Well, this is a fun energy.

252
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:38,577
你不会正好有个表妹
Do you happen to have a cousin

253
00:09:38,577 --> 00:09:41,120
特别喜欢穿短裙 又喜怒无常吧
partial to Western skirts and terrifying mood swings?

254
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:42,160
我们需要他 闭嘴乖乖干活
We need him. Just do it.

255
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,860
这些胡萝卜切得一塌糊涂
Those carrots are a mess.

256
00:09:43,940 --> 00:09:44,680
应该这样切
It's like this.

257
00:09:44,740 --> 00:09:45,240
等等 什么
Wait, what --

258
00:09:45,760 --> 00:09:46,420
老天
Oh, man.

259
00:09:46,620 --> 00:09:48,000
你真的很知道自己想要什么
You really know what you want.

260
00:09:48,420 --> 00:09:49,340
我觉得好有安全感
I feel so safe.

261
00:09:50,680 --> 00:09:51,860
那个要再加点盐
That needs more salt.

262
00:09:51,860 --> 00:09:53,220
那个要再加点奶油
That needs more cream.

263
00:09:53,305 --> 00:09:55,940
艾丽克斯 那烤箱里有个蛋奶酥
And, Alex, I have a souffle in that oven

264
00:09:55,940 --> 00:09:57,320
正英勇地膨胀升起
valiantly trying to rise.

265
00:09:57,380 --> 00:09:59,380
你能不能别死命用力砸核桃
Would you mind not pounding those walnuts

266
00:09:59,380 --> 00:10:01,740
你以为你是《巴黎圣母院》里猛敲钟的钟楼怪人吗
like you're Quasimodo just going at his bell?

267
00:10:01,940 --> 00:10:04,220
知道吗 尼尔 我不知道如何...
You know what, Neil? I don't know how --

268
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,420
这个会不会太热啦
Are these too hot?

269
00:10:09,060 --> 00:10:11,180
克莱尔 你为什么在清洗我们家的窗户
Claire? Why are you washing our windows?

270
00:10:11,640 --> 00:10:12,480
我不知道
I don't know.

271
00:10:12,730 --> 00:10:15,884
它们很脏 你妈又找到了一根长杆
They were really dirty, and your mom found a pole.

272
00:10:16,094 --> 00:10:17,499
说来也巧
You know, funny coincidence --

273
00:10:17,540 --> 00:10:19,720
上周 有人请我去一家制造杆子的公司
last week, I was offered the top job

274
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:20,840
任职高层
at a company that makes poles.

275
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:23,180
对 我也正在经历人生难关
Yeah, I'm going through something, too.

276
00:10:23,280 --> 00:10:25,180
总之 我拒绝了那份工作
Anyway, I turned the job down,

277
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,920
但现在我又重新开始考虑去不去
but I think I'm reconsidering it.

278
00:10:26,980 --> 00:10:28,060
她叫杰西卡
Her name is Jessica.

279
00:10:28,340 --> 00:10:31,500
我知道杆子不像衣柜那么性感迷人
I know that poles aren't as sexy as closets.

280
00:10:31,780 --> 00:10:34,300
但人们好像真的很喜欢杆子
But people really seem to like them,

281
00:10:34,379 --> 00:10:36,519
而且它们出了名地不受经济衰退影响
and they are famously recession-proof.

282
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:38,570
天啊 我想我犯了个严重的错误
Oh, God. I think I made a terrible mistake.

283
00:10:38,570 --> 00:10:41,624
我得打给那些人 接受那份工作 不然就给别人了
I got to call those people and get that job before it goes away.

284
00:10:41,697 --> 00:10:43,928
-因为 -别打 克莱尔 那工作配不上你
- Because -- - Don't do it, Claire! It's beneath you!

285
00:10:44,700 --> 00:10:45,760
曼尼 放尊重点
Manny, show some respect!

286
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:46,800
要是没有杆子
If it weren't for poles,

287
00:10:46,800 --> 00:10:48,660
你向国旗宣誓就会像对脚踏垫宣誓了
you would be pledging allegiance to a floor mat!

288
00:10:48,780 --> 00:10:49,760
-把手机给我 -不给
- Now, give me my phone! - No!

289
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:51,740
你不能在过渡期轻易接受备胎
You can't take a job on the rebound.

290
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,260
那只能让你开心一下
It'll feel good for a minute,

291
00:10:53,260 --> 00:10:56,660
可之后你会坠入多疑与悔恨的虚空
but then you're plummeting down a K-hole of paranoia and regret.

292
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,000
你这周过得如何
How was your week?

293
00:10:59,580 --> 00:11:01,360
好吧 我告诉你我为什么穿了高领衫
Fine. I'll tell you why I'm wearing a turtleneck.

294
00:11:01,880 --> 00:11:03,100
在雪莉甩了我后
After Sherry dumped me,

295
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:04,880
我和第一个看得上我的女孩交往了
I dated the first girl who would have me --

296
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:07,700
讽刺的是 她是校篮球队的篮板王[备胎]
ironically, the leading rebounder on our basketball team.

297
00:11:08,500 --> 00:11:10,240
这是被她用护齿牙套打的
That's where she hit me with her mouth guard.

298
00:11:10,680 --> 00:11:11,640
我试过和她分手
I've tried to leave her,

299
00:11:11,640 --> 00:11:13,800
可她单手抓住我的头 让我只能原地跑
but she just palms my head, and I run in place.

300
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:16,000
很遗憾你经历了这些 曼尼
Well, I'm sorry this is happening to you, Manny,

301
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,460
但这和我有什么...
but what does this have to do with --

302
00:11:17,460 --> 00:11:19,020
她就是杆子公司 克莱尔
She's the pole company, Claire.

303
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:20,857
从我的错误中学习经验
Learn from my mistake --

304
00:11:20,857 --> 00:11:23,080
除非你想被拍下
unless you want a compromising Polaroid of you

305
00:11:23,080 --> 00:11:24,740
你被挂在女生更衣室高处的耻辱照
hung up very high in the women's locker room.

306
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:27,000
这梯子一会借我用用吧
I might need to borrow that ladder later.

307
00:11:34,180 --> 00:11:34,660
克莱尔
Claire!

308
00:11:35,700 --> 00:11:37,920
你稍后想不想帮我在购物网站
Do you want to help me shop online later

309
00:11:37,920 --> 00:11:39,600
选一些职业装
for some power suits?

310
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:43,220
老天 我真怀念能像你这样
Oh, God, I miss wearing comfortable clothes

311
00:11:43,220 --> 00:11:44,687
一直穿着舒适的衣服
all the time, like you do.

312
00:11:44,687 --> 00:11:47,900
是啊 听起来很有趣
Yep. It sounds like a lot of fun.

313
00:11:47,900 --> 00:11:48,460
我
I --

314
00:11:48,460 --> 00:11:49,200
我在做什么
What am I doing?

315
00:11:49,640 --> 00:11:51,229
做得好极了 再接再厉
A terrific job. Keep going!

316
00:11:51,229 --> 00:11:52,150
不
N-no!

317
00:11:52,280 --> 00:11:54,800
我自打到这以后就一直在冒汗
I have been sweating ever since I got here.

318
00:11:54,900 --> 00:11:58,000
你是不是骗我帮你做家务
Did you trick me into doing your housework?

319
00:11:58,520 --> 00:11:58,920
没有
No.

320
00:12:04,340 --> 00:12:05,560
你手机根本没响
That phone did not ring!

321
00:12:05,560 --> 00:12:07,640
你走开是因为你知道你有罪
You're walking away because you know you're guilty!

322
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:09,960
把鞋脱了 我刚擦过地
And take those shoes off! I just did the floors!

323
00:12:10,692 --> 00:12:13,100
朋友们对我们"离婚"的反应
My friends' reaction to our "divorce"

324
00:12:13,100 --> 00:12:14,540
真的让我很不舒服
really bothered me.

325
00:12:14,540 --> 00:12:16,420
于是我对小卡找了个借口
So I made an excuse to Cam

326
00:12:16,420 --> 00:12:18,000
然后去了朗吉尼斯的派对
and went over to Longinus' party.

327
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:19,680
我想让朋友们知道
I wanted the friends to know

328
00:12:19,680 --> 00:12:21,840
我和小卡一样在情感上总要人哄
that I am just as emotionally needy as Cam!

329
00:12:27,260 --> 00:12:28,600
妹子
Hey, girl, hey!

330
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:29,640
真不敢相信你来了
I can't believe you came.

331
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:31,040
我的天 小卡还好吗
Oh, my God. How's Cam?!

332
00:12:31,060 --> 00:12:33,200
-是啊 他还好吗 -小卡很好 他没事
- Yes, how is he? - Cam's fine. He's fine.

333
00:12:33,400 --> 00:12:34,960
那不过是个大误会
It was just a big misunderstanding.

334
00:12:35,220 --> 00:12:36,300
我们没有离婚
We're not getting a divorce.

335
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:39,960
妹子 快进来
Well, girl, come on in.

336
00:12:39,980 --> 00:12:41,280
让我给你拿两杯酒
Let's get you two drinks --

337
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:43,920
毕竟你两手空空来了派对 一手一杯
one for each empty hand you showed up to the party with.

338
00:12:44,170 --> 00:12:46,400
我真的需要喝一杯
Well, I-I could use it.

339
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:49,260
尽管我们没有真的离婚
I mean, even though it's-it's not true about the divorce,

340
00:12:49,420 --> 00:12:51,381
说不定某天就真的离了
it could be -- you know, someday.

341
00:12:51,381 --> 00:12:53,480
这让我 让我特别...
And that just-that just makes me so, so...

342
00:12:55,560 --> 00:12:56,560
困惑
Confused?

343
00:12:57,280 --> 00:12:58,520
生气 愤怒
Angry? Furious.

344
00:12:58,800 --> 00:12:59,540
《速度与激情》
"The Fast and the Furious"!

345
00:12:59,540 --> 00:13:00,740
这不是在玩猜谜游戏
Okay, this isn't charades.

346
00:13:00,740 --> 00:13:01,600
我很悲伤
I'm sad.

347
00:13:01,980 --> 00:13:03,200
-那是你悲伤的表情吗 -是的
- That's your sad? - Yes.

348
00:13:03,680 --> 00:13:05,180
-那是你悲伤的表情 -是的
- That's your sad? - Yeah.

349
00:13:05,702 --> 00:13:07,615
我现在真的很需要你们的支持
And I-I really need your support right now.

350
00:13:09,680 --> 00:13:11,320
等等 他有点新状况
Wait, something new is happening.

351
00:13:13,980 --> 00:13:14,960
我的天
Oh, my God!

352
00:13:15,100 --> 00:13:17,700
你们怎么看不出我现在有多真情流露
How can you not see how emotionally raw I am right now?

353
00:13:18,860 --> 00:13:20,020
世事无常
Nothing lasts forever.

354
00:13:20,380 --> 00:13:21,740
一切结束后我们该何去何从
What happens when it's over?

355
00:13:22,520 --> 00:13:24,460
可怜的小卡 他是那么脆弱
Poor Cam. He is so fragile.

356
00:13:24,460 --> 00:13:26,880
-他肯定会发疯 -我们会陪他熬过去的
- He's really gonna lose it. - We'll be there for him.

357
00:13:26,880 --> 00:13:28,580
有谁会帮我拭去这些泪水
Who will be there to dry these tears?

358
00:13:30,400 --> 00:13:31,340
哪有泪水
What tears?

359
00:13:32,288 --> 00:13:33,365
泪水在哪呢
Where they at?

360
00:13:38,085 --> 00:13:39,960
不 又来了
Ay, no, not again!

361
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:42,280
这次不是我 是他自己撞的
It wasn't me this time. He did it to himself.

362
00:13:42,280 --> 00:13:43,700
和上次不一样
Unlike last time,

363
00:13:43,780 --> 00:13:46,360
上次是你故意让飞机撞到我脸上
when you purposely flew that plane into my face.

364
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:47,840
你是个禽兽 杰
You're a monster, Jay.

365
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:49,320
你说谁是禽兽
Who are you calling a monster?

366
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:50,880
他刚说了 是杰
Um, he just said -- Jay.

367
00:13:51,480 --> 00:13:52,400
太不值了
This isn't worth it!

368
00:13:52,400 --> 00:13:53,960
我就不该跟别人一起做任何事
Why do I do anything with people?

369
00:13:54,720 --> 00:13:56,920
我很确定你没有脑震荡
I'm pretty sure you don't have a concussion,

370
00:13:56,920 --> 00:13:58,720
但为了以防万一 我在这陪你
but I'm gonna stay here just in case,

371
00:13:58,720 --> 00:13:59,800
不让你睡着
so you don't fall asleep.

372
00:14:00,940 --> 00:14:03,140
歌洛莉亚 你去叫邓太太过来好吗
Gloria, should you go get Mrs. D?

373
00:14:03,140 --> 00:14:05,600
当然 我看看能不能找到她
Oh, yeah, sure. I'll see if I can find her.

374
00:14:08,360 --> 00:14:08,800
克莱尔
Claire?

375
00:14:14,140 --> 00:14:14,560
看到小卡了吗
Seen Cam?

376
00:14:15,020 --> 00:14:17,180
也祝您感恩节快乐
And a Happy Thanksgiving to you.

377
00:14:17,420 --> 00:14:19,200
脾气真大 你听起来跟我爸一样
Oh, that's a lot of attitude. You sound like my dad.

378
00:14:19,480 --> 00:14:20,420
是咱爸
Our dad!

379
00:14:21,200 --> 00:14:25,179
你回来了 我刚收到朗吉尼斯的短信
There you are. So, I just, uh, got a text message from Longinus.

380
00:14:25,179 --> 00:14:27,800
他说你把墨镜落在感朋节派对上了
Said you left your sunglasses at his Friendsgiving party --

381
00:14:27,800 --> 00:14:30,340
那个你判定我们没时间去的派对
the one you decreed we didn't have enough time to go to.

382
00:14:30,420 --> 00:14:32,020
米奇尔 你欠我一个道歉
Mitchell, you owe me an apology.

383
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:33,920
我欠你一个道歉
I owe you an apology?

384
00:14:35,040 --> 00:14:37,240
尽管我没带礼物去朗吉尼斯的派对
I may not have brought a gift to Longinus' party,

385
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:38,940
但我可收到一份大礼
but I sure left with one.

386
00:14:38,940 --> 00:14:42,080
就像他连别人哭都没见过似的
It's like he's never seen someone cry before.

387
00:14:43,080 --> 00:14:44,420
想想难过的事
Just think of something sad.

388
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:45,798
例如宠物死掉
Like when a pet died,

389
00:14:45,798 --> 00:14:48,600
或是勒迈克去做金球奖填空座的
or when L'Michael was a seat filler at the Golden Globes

390
00:14:48,600 --> 00:14:50,540
结果身边居然是妮可·基德曼
and got to sit next to Nicole Kidman.

391
00:14:50,738 --> 00:14:50,858
他丫凭什么
Why him?!

392
00:14:50,858 --> 00:14:55,069
托勒密 这件事你必须看开
Ptolemy, you must get over that.

393
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:57,880
我们都围着小卡转的唯一原因是
Look, the only reason we all rallied around Cam was,

394
00:14:57,880 --> 00:14:59,203
你们上次分手时
last time y'all broke up,

395
00:14:59,320 --> 00:15:01,440
他崩溃了 而你似乎没事
he was shattered and you seemed fine.

396
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:03,760
什么上次分手
What last time?

397
00:15:05,920 --> 00:15:07,240
貌似好多年前
Apparently, years ago,

398
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:09,980
小卡假装他和我分手了
Cam invented a breakup that never really happened,

399
00:15:09,980 --> 00:15:12,760
就为了估摸一下万一我们真的分手了
just so he could gauge how much support he could count on

400
00:15:12,760 --> 00:15:14,060
会有多少人关心他
in the event of the real thing.

401
00:15:15,060 --> 00:15:15,520
太"正常"了
Normal.

402
00:15:16,180 --> 00:15:18,581
都怪我太过爱他
It's my fault for loving him too much!

403
00:15:18,581 --> 00:15:19,634
不不不不
No! No! No! No!

404
00:15:19,634 --> 00:15:21,160
-你能找到更好的 -别这么对自己
- You can do so much better. - Don't do this to yourself.

405
00:15:21,160 --> 00:15:22,783
-亲爱的 -就是说
- Honey. - Yes.

406
00:15:22,860 --> 00:15:25,260
你让所有人都不站在我这边
You turned everyone against me!

407
00:15:25,740 --> 00:15:27,920
因为情侣分手后 朋友们会选择一边
Because in a breakup, friends choose a side,

408
00:15:27,920 --> 00:15:31,460
而我比你更脆弱 我会更需要他们
and I'm-I'm more fragile, and I would need them more.

409
00:15:31,460 --> 00:15:33,300
我只是为了紧急情况未雨绸缪
I was just preparing for an emergency.

410
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:35,980
你买地震急救包的时候我对你生气了吗
I didn't yell at you when you bought that, uh, earthquake kit.

411
00:15:35,980 --> 00:15:38,960
你告诉他们我会几天不见人
You told them I disappear for days at a time.

412
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:40,000
你之所以知道这些
Which you wouldn't know about

413
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:41,840
都是因为背着我自己去了派对
had you not gone to the party behind my back.

414
00:15:41,957 --> 00:15:43,188
我们之间的信任哪去了 米奇尔
Where's the trust, Mitchell?

415
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:48,480
这地方看起来很适合躲避狗血剧
Looks like a good place to hide from the drama.

416
00:15:48,580 --> 00:15:50,820
爸 我现在很生你老婆的气
Dad, I am so mad at your wife right now.

417
00:15:50,880 --> 00:15:52,880
-我得建一整幢客房 -不不不
- I need a guest house. - No, no, no.

418
00:15:52,880 --> 00:15:55,340
她完全是在利用我的坐立不安
She-She has completely taken advantage of my restlessness

419
00:15:55,340 --> 00:15:57,060
基本上让我变成了她的管家
and basically turned me into her housekeeper.

420
00:15:57,180 --> 00:15:58,820
怎么做的 故意做不好某件事
How? By doing something the wrong way,

421
00:15:58,820 --> 00:16:00,560
知道你肯定会插手做到完美吗
knowing you'll jump in and do it the right way?

422
00:16:00,860 --> 00:16:03,180
我是怎么回事 为什么总刷不干净杯子
What's wrong with me? Why can't I get these clean?

423
00:16:03,500 --> 00:16:04,340
门都没有
Not gonna happen.

424
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:07,120
我也有责任
I am partly to blame.

425
00:16:07,380 --> 00:16:10,320
我这个人就是闲不下来
I'm not good at doing nothing.

426
00:16:11,220 --> 00:16:14,280
他们指纹是怎么沾进杯子内侧的啊
How did they get fingerprints on the inside of the glass?

427
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:15,060
真是要命了
It's crazy.

428
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:18,400
我刚把公司交接给你的时候也有这情况
You know, I had a similar experience when I turned the company over to you.

429
00:16:18,560 --> 00:16:20,460
我怀念的不是公司的各种事务
It wasn't the activity that I missed.

430
00:16:21,100 --> 00:16:22,340
我怀念的是当老板的感觉
I missed being the boss.

431
00:16:23,043 --> 00:16:24,273
是的 我有同感
Oh! Yeah. I hear you there.

432
00:16:24,524 --> 00:16:26,980
发号施令 令员工闻风丧胆
Giving orders, people scared of you.

433
00:16:26,980 --> 00:16:29,840
我喜爱白日喝酒 但更喜爱在权力中沉醉
I like day drinking, but nothing beats being drunk with power.

434
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:30,620
是啊
Yeah.

435
00:16:30,680 --> 00:16:33,680
猜猜我在公司说过多少个难笑笑话
Do you know how many unfunny jokes I told at the office?

436
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:35,382
-零个 -没错
- None? - Exactly.

437
00:16:35,382 --> 00:16:36,254
叩叩叩[常见笑话开头] "哈哈哈哈哈哈
Knock knock. "Ha ha ha ha!

438
00:16:36,254 --> 00:16:37,580
太好笑啦 老板 哈哈哈哈哈
Good one, boss! Ha ha ha ha!

439
00:16:37,580 --> 00:16:39,080
您是怎么一直那么有哏的啊"
How do you keep coming up with them?"

440
00:16:39,460 --> 00:16:40,580
没骨气的马屁精
Spineless bootlickers.

441
00:16:40,900 --> 00:16:41,880
天啊 我好想念他们
God, I miss them.

442
00:16:42,700 --> 00:16:44,140
你是怎么熬过来的
How did you get over it?

443
00:16:44,140 --> 00:16:46,340
我并没有等别人再来给我领导大位
I didn't wait around for someone to put me in charge again.

444
00:16:46,640 --> 00:16:48,020
而是自己创造机会
I made my own opportunity.

445
00:16:48,200 --> 00:16:49,660
老爸 卖狗床吗
Dad, dog beds?

446
00:16:50,100 --> 00:16:51,080
比杆子强多了
Better than poles.

447
00:16:53,500 --> 00:16:55,020
是的 我也是有听到事情的
Oh, yeah. I hear things.

448
00:16:56,506 --> 00:16:57,300
好啦
Alright.

449
00:16:57,300 --> 00:16:59,140
双胞胎现在由迪兰在照顾
Dylan is on twin duty,

450
00:16:59,140 --> 00:17:01,500
所以我得确保你没有睡着
so I'm gonna make sure you don't fall asleep.

451
00:17:01,500 --> 00:17:04,140
我过去十年根本如睡死了一般
I've been asleep for the last 10 years.

452
00:17:04,840 --> 00:17:07,500
想象一下发现自己碰到的撞机事件并不是意外
Imagine finding out the plane crash you were in was no accident.

453
00:17:07,680 --> 00:17:09,060
你不孤单
Well, you're not alone.

454
00:17:09,420 --> 00:17:10,640
杰也对我做过这类的事情
Jay did something very similar to me

455
00:17:10,640 --> 00:17:11,880
我跟米奇尔刚在一起时也发生过
when Mitchell and I first got together.

456
00:17:12,120 --> 00:17:14,422
他"意外"开车碰撞到我
He "accidentally" bumped me with his car --

457
00:17:14,422 --> 00:17:16,360
真的车 可不是遥控玩具
a real car, not a -- not a toy.

458
00:17:17,600 --> 00:17:18,959
我挺伤痕累累的
I was pretty bruised up.

459
00:17:18,959 --> 00:17:20,660
我... 我一开始还以为
I just -- I just assumed it was because

460
00:17:20,660 --> 00:17:22,220
他是见不得儿子找了个男人
he didn't want his son with a boyfriend,

461
00:17:22,220 --> 00:17:24,580
但其实是他觉得米奇尔可以找到更好的
but he thought Mitchell could do better.

462
00:17:24,619 --> 00:17:26,571
我当时真是有点震惊
It was a-a bit of a shock.

463
00:17:28,300 --> 00:17:30,280
但是当我后来也成为人父后
But then, once I became a father,

464
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:32,990
我意识到了自己也有多护犊子
I realized how protective you can be over your kid.

465
00:17:32,990 --> 00:17:35,250
莉莉的足球队上有个小男孩总闹她
There was a little boy on Lily's soccer team always teasing her,

466
00:17:35,250 --> 00:17:36,838
所以在赛季末派对时
so at the end-of-the-season party,

467
00:17:36,838 --> 00:17:39,560
我貌似意外地把他的脸
I may have nudged him face-first

468
00:17:39,560 --> 00:17:41,780
摁进了一个新做好的炸蛋糕
into a freshly fried funnel cake.

469
00:17:43,660 --> 00:17:47,380
我不得不承认 的确是有可能
It is possible that I have more in common

470
00:17:47,380 --> 00:17:50,380
我跟杰这样的爸爸 有很多共同之处
with dads like Jay than I would like to admit.

471
00:17:52,300 --> 00:17:54,500
邓先生 抱歉我吃掉了最后一个华夫饼
Sorry I ate the last waffle, Mr. D.

472
00:17:54,500 --> 00:17:56,820
我最近特别饿
I've been so hungry lately.

473
00:17:57,420 --> 00:17:59,660
不知道是不是代表我跟海莉又怀了
I wonder if that means we're pregnant again.

474
00:18:02,660 --> 00:18:03,540
哎呀 糟糕
Oh, shoot!

475
00:18:03,582 --> 00:18:04,980
糟糕
Shoot!

476
00:18:04,980 --> 00:18:06,240
糟糕 糟糕 糟糕
Shoot, shoot, shoot.

477
00:18:11,360 --> 00:18:12,580
恭喜你 艾丽克斯
Congratulations, Alex.

478
00:18:12,620 --> 00:18:14,920
一群快饿死的兔子也不愿意吃这胡萝卜
A warren of starving rabbits wouldn't eat these carrots.

479
00:18:15,020 --> 00:18:17,180
我开始考虑我们是不是只应该保持肉体关系了
I'm starting to wonder if our relationship should just be sexual.

480
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:18,640
好了 尼尔 说实话...
Okay, Neil, honestly --

481
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:21,071
两位爱侣 这些事之后再说
Hey, hey, hey, you lovebirds! Time for that later.

482
00:18:21,071 --> 00:18:22,360
我们还有大餐要准备呢
We got a meal to finish.

483
00:18:22,360 --> 00:18:25,500
谁快打给联邦应急管理局 这蛋白酥就是场灾难
Can somebody call FEMA? This meringue is a disaster.

484
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:26,960
我只是照你说的做了
I just did what you told me.

485
00:18:27,020 --> 00:18:28,720
是吗 我有叫你没打发蛋白吗
Oh, really? I told you to underbeat the egg whites?

486
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:30,160
我真的觉得...
I really think --

487
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:31,480
我觉得你就是这样
I think. You do.

488
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:33,699
尼尔 你帮完艾丽克斯了吗
Oh, Neil. Are you done with Alex?

489
00:18:33,699 --> 00:18:36,700
我磨杏仁这一步碰到了一点问题
'Cause I'm having trouble slivering these almonds.

490
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:37,980
与我合体
Be one with me.

491
00:18:41,720 --> 00:18:44,300
杰
Hey, Jay, um...

492
00:18:44,300 --> 00:18:46,520
我今天好像反应过度了
I think I overreacted earlier.

493
00:18:46,920 --> 00:18:48,200
我想跟你道歉
I want to apologize.

494
00:18:48,780 --> 00:18:49,840
算了啦
Forget it.

495
00:18:49,840 --> 00:18:53,520
我如果说实话 或许某种程度上
If I'm being honest, maybe on some level...

496
00:18:54,240 --> 00:18:56,080
我真是故意用飞机去撞你的
I really did want to hit you with that plane.

497
00:18:57,520 --> 00:18:58,520
抱歉啊 菲尔
I'm sorry, Phil.

498
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:00,500
谢谢
Thank you.

499
00:19:01,340 --> 00:19:03,080
或许我... 现在也能理解
Maybe I, uh, understand better

500
00:19:03,080 --> 00:19:04,820
爸爸会想要保护女儿的心情
why a father might want to protect a daughter.

501
00:19:05,151 --> 00:19:06,158
或是保护儿子
Or a son.

502
00:19:06,340 --> 00:19:08,860
在我认可小卡前 我也狠狠撞过他一次
I banged Cam up pretty good before I gave him the nod.

503
00:19:09,600 --> 00:19:10,840
他一直都没发现是故意的
He never figured it out.

504
00:19:13,020 --> 00:19:16,060
我也有这种冲动 我承认我也有罪
I get the impulse. I'm -- I'm guilty of it myself.

505
00:19:16,060 --> 00:19:17,860
但排解愤怒应该有比伤害他人
But there's got to be a better way of handling anger

506
00:19:17,860 --> 00:19:19,220
更好的办法吧
than hurting someone, right?

507
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:21,940
太恶心了吧
Disgusting!

508
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:23,800
如果这是史上第一次感恩节
If this was the first Thanksgiving,

509
00:19:24,060 --> 00:19:25,440
那你这肉汁就是这个国家
your gravy would be the worst thing

510
00:19:25,440 --> 00:19:27,100
对原住民做过最坏的事情了吧
this country has done to Native Americans!

511
00:19:27,460 --> 00:19:28,000
兄弟
Hey, buddy.

512
00:19:28,420 --> 00:19:28,940
怎么了
Yeah?

513
00:19:35,120 --> 00:19:36,800
绝非有意的意外啊
What a senseless accident.

514
00:19:37,340 --> 00:19:38,340
搞屁啊
What the hell?!

515
00:19:39,320 --> 00:19:40,940
又不是什么大不了的事情
It's not the end of the world.

516
00:19:41,500 --> 00:19:42,920
厨师不需要嗅觉啦
Chefs don't need to smell things.

517
00:19:43,440 --> 00:19:45,880
你们这帮人神经病啊 我要走了
You people are crazy. I'm getting out of here.

518
00:19:45,880 --> 00:19:47,360
真是个绝佳的好主意啊
What a splendid idea.

519
00:19:49,100 --> 00:19:50,360
享受这被毁蛋奶酥吧
Enjoy the souffle.

520
00:19:53,600 --> 00:19:54,540
你最好了
You're the best.

521
00:19:55,120 --> 00:19:57,700
怎么回事 刚才是大厨走的声音吗
Whoa. What's going on? Did I just hear the chef leave?

522
00:19:57,840 --> 00:20:00,120
没救了 我连这是什么都看不出来
It's hopeless. I can't even tell what this was.

523
00:20:00,140 --> 00:20:02,640
我问问有有没有餐厅有位子吧
Well, I'll see if there's a restaurant that can take us.

524
00:20:02,860 --> 00:20:03,855
我们回家吧
I'm just going home.

525
00:20:03,855 --> 00:20:06,020
不不不不不 不行
No. No, no, no, no! Whoa, whoa, whoa! No!

526
00:20:06,020 --> 00:20:07,600
谁都不准走
No one is going anywhere.

527
00:20:07,800 --> 00:20:10,000
听我说 其实我们还能挽救这个感恩节
Listen, you know what? We can salvage this Thanksgiving.

528
00:20:10,500 --> 00:20:11,820
菲尔 去开始搞沙拉
Phil, you get the salad started.

529
00:20:12,080 --> 00:20:13,740
卢克 任何没完全毁掉的东西
Luke, anything you don't need

530
00:20:13,740 --> 00:20:15,520
都留着抢救
dental records to identify, save.

531
00:20:15,520 --> 00:20:18,600
艾丽克斯 那男的就是个傻逼 找个好点的
Alex, that guy was an idiot. Pick better boyfriends.

532
00:20:19,360 --> 00:20:22,020
对不起了 妈 我很想帮你搞定的
I'm sorry, Mom. I so wanted to do this for you.

533
00:20:22,140 --> 00:20:23,340
亲爱的 没事
Oh, honey, no.

534
00:20:23,480 --> 00:20:25,260
你给了我最棒的礼物
You gave me the best gift ever.

535
00:20:25,480 --> 00:20:27,580
我又可以指挥使唤大家了
I'm bossing people around again!

536
00:20:28,500 --> 00:20:29,880
卢克 切点胡萝卜
Luke, chop some carrots.

537
00:20:30,080 --> 00:20:31,580
听我说 我那时只是...
Look, I guess I just --

538
00:20:31,580 --> 00:20:34,260
觉得如果哪天你离开我了 我一定活不下去
I didn't think I would be able to survive if you ever left me.

539
00:20:34,720 --> 00:20:35,980
我此刻还是这么认为
And I still don't.

540
00:20:36,340 --> 00:20:37,100
谢谢
Thank you.

541
00:20:37,460 --> 00:20:39,680
那派对也没那么好玩啦
And the party wasn't that fun.

542
00:20:40,320 --> 00:20:41,320
缺了点什么
Something was missing.

543
00:20:42,180 --> 00:20:45,800
我就喜欢你说事不说明白的姿态
Oh, I love when you say things without really saying them.

544
00:20:47,420 --> 00:20:48,400
你是指我 对吧
You meant me, right?

545
00:20:52,900 --> 00:20:53,740
《无脸的男人》
Man without a face.

546
00:20:54,140 --> 00:20:54,740
《木乃伊》
The mummy.

547
00:20:54,987 --> 00:20:55,773
《昏迷》
Coma.

548
00:20:56,154 --> 00:20:57,673
《我 机器人》
I-robot?

549
00:20:57,880 --> 00:20:58,420
《冰雪奇缘》
Frozen?

550
00:20:59,480 --> 00:21:00,960
《哭泣的游戏》
The crying game.

551
00:21:01,614 --> 00:21:03,112
你们是不是傻啊
What is wrong with you people?

552
00:21:03,459 --> 00:21:05,136
如果你们想看哭泣
If you want to see crying,

553
00:21:05,220 --> 00:21:07,220
那他应该跟着我进厨房
he should come and see me in the kitchen

554
00:21:07,220 --> 00:21:08,780
看看有多少脏碗盘要洗
with all these dirty dishes.

555
00:21:09,060 --> 00:21:11,900
行行行 我帮忙洗盘子跟银制餐具
Fine. I'll do plates and I'll do silverware.

556
00:21:11,900 --> 00:21:13,740
但拒绝需要先泡过再洗的东西
But nothing that requires soaking.

557
00:21:14,940 --> 00:21:16,220
你们可真可爱
You guys are so cute.

558
00:21:16,560 --> 00:21:17,604
乔治可爱
Well... George is.

559
00:21:17,604 --> 00:21:18,973
但茵素需要有点个性
Poppy is going to need a personality.

560
00:21:19,620 --> 00:21:21,200
抱歉了兄弟
Oh! Sorry dude.

561
00:21:21,440 --> 00:21:22,260
绝对是意外
Total accident.

562
00:21:23,520 --> 00:21:25,100
他会是一个好爸爸
He's gonna be a good dad.
